{"3297790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "icobeat", "steam_appid": 3297790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;icobeat&quot; puts you in a hostile triangular universe where everything is subject to rhythm - the playing field, obstacles, visuals and your actions. You are just a small pyramid, whose difficult task is to survive to the end of the track.<br><br>To do this, you will need to dodge the enemies, chain combos and master your abilities to transform the playing field - all in perfect sync with the beat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297790/extras/c72fee89acef9da14afb02de0f94a739.avif?t=1778935035\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297790/extras_big/c72fee89acef9da14afb02de0f94a739.avif?t=1778935035 width=800 height=228 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse</strong> yourself in the experience of  icobeating</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play</strong> through 8 captivating  levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master </strong>your play style with abilities to change environment around you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy</strong> 10+ unique soundtracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch</strong> 6 mind-bending audio visualizers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rebel</strong> against God (or not)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover</strong> accessibility options to tweak your game experience</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCLAIMER:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game primarily consists of sections and scenes with flashing lights and images that may trigger seizures in peo